== how many steps to the screen, measured ==
-- step 1: the flag is discoverable at depth 1 (top-level help), no doc dive:
   grep -c -- --signals <(rabadon --help)  ->  1
-- step 2: the screen itself, one command, no flags to configure, no file to edit:
real 0,02
   STEPS TYPED = 2  (rabadon --help ; rabadon usage --signals)
   STEPS TYPED IF ALREADY KNOWN = 1
